{"user_request": "Start planning Mom's spring 2028 Austin visit. Create a short note explaining the agreed ordinary-week format, including what normal work schedules it can contain, then text Mom asking for two or three possible date ranges. Do not build an itinerary before dates are settled.", "today": "2028-01-01", "tool": "create_doc", "arguments": {"title": "Mom’s Spring 2028 Austin Visit — Agreed Format", "body": "## Agreed ordinary-week format

Plan for a normal five-to-seven-night week, not a holiday-style itinerary. I’ll keep my workdays and Sam will keep his restaurant shifts; the visit can include painting together, walks, meals at home, and unstructured time. Once dates are settled, choose one shared plan rather than building a full itinerary.", "folder": "Planning"}, "checks": [{"check_id": "riley_095_03", "path": "args", "criterion": "The note plans one spring 2028 Austin visit with dates still unsettled, uses a five-to-seven-night ordinary-week format that can include Riley's workdays and Sam's shifts, and defers choosing the single shared plan until after dates are settled rather than creating a full itinerary.", "value": {"title": "Mom’s Spring 2028 Austin Visit — Agreed Format", "body": "## Agreed ordinary-week format

Plan for a normal five-to-seven-night week, not a holiday-style itinerary. I’ll keep my workdays and Sam will keep his restaurant shifts; the visit can include painting together, walks, meals at home, and unstructured time. Once dates are settled, choose one shared plan rather than building a full itinerary.", "folder": "Planning"}}]}
